\subsection{Exact scalar endpoints}
The exact values used in the upper density estimate are
\begin{align}
 E_{\rm up}&=\frac{9979702576710911234850619807816847864907359959}
 {1475913550962201227946780619099353215139840000},
 \label{eq:current-E}\\
 u&=\frac{145007961227048312210593427530128000784681}
 {11807308407697609823574244952794825721118720000}.
 \label{eq:current-u}
\end{align}
For the lower construction, before the paired-fibre increment, put
\begin{align}
 R_{\rm base}&=
 \frac{1345575129530003739571681432301188857312754737}
 {685738127494661151198444592354557952000000000},
 \label{eq:base-R}\\
 B_{\rm base}&=
 \frac{2504748318091942808229694219379799307550987}
 {5485905019957289209587556738836463616000000000}.
